&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;Experience with operating systems such as Linux, Unix, and Free BSD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;Experience troubleshooting network issues and familiarity with tools such as Ping, Traceroute, and MTR&lt;/p&gt;
