&lt;p&gt;As the Sr. Product Manager for Data Protection, you will be the strategic architect of our mission-critical data resilience portfolio. You will sit at the high-stakes intersection of enterprise storage, cybersecurity, and cloud operations, designing solutions that ensure our global customers’ data is instantly available and resilient against modern cyber threats. Collaborating deeply with Engineering, the CTO office, and GTM teams, you won&#39;t just manage backup features—you will define how organizations survive and recover from sophisticated ransomware and&amp;nbsp;security events.&lt;/p&gt;
