&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect the Data Resilience Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and execute a technical roadmap for data protection, prioritizing high-impact security features, automated recovery, and cloud-native integrations that create distinct market advantages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
