&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Category-Level Outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the complete product lifecycle from ideation to launch, establishing clear KPIs for recovery time objectives (RTO), recovery point objectives (RPO), and feature adoption to ensure maximum business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
